---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, PROOF, SERVICES, REVENUE_PROOF } from '../data/site';
const team = [
  { name: 'Kunal Arora', role: 'Founder. Leads strategy and runs email, outreach, funnels and automation.', img: '/img/kunal-arora.webp', href: '/kunal-arora/' },
  { name: 'Barbara Arora', role: 'Co-founder. Client strategy, social media and campaign planning.', img: '/img/barbara-arora.webp' },
  { name: 'Rahul Arora', role: 'Creative director. Ad creative, video, design and landing pages.', img: '/img/rahul-arora.webp' },
];
---
<Base title="About Us: The Grow Revenue Company Team | Grow Revenue"
  description="The Grow Revenue Company is a London marketing firm founded by Kunal Arora that grows revenue through ads, social media, content, lead generation and email."
  path="/about/" pageType="trust" crumbs={[{ name: 'About', path: '/about/' }]}>
  <section class="phero">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
        <h1 data-split>We are a marketing company named after the <em>only result</em> that matters.</h1>
        <p class="lead reveal">The Grow Revenue Company is a London-based marketing firm founded by Kunal Arora. For over eleven years we have grown revenue for businesses through whichever channel earns it best: paid ads, social media, content, lead generation, email marketing, funnels and now AI automation.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="ico" src="/img/3d/growth.webp" alt="3D rising bar chart with an arrow and coins representing revenue growth" width="480" height="480" fetchpriority="high" />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow prose">
      <h2>Why do we measure everything by revenue?</h2>
      <p>Because clicks, followers and open rates can all go up while sales stay flat. Every engagement starts with a baseline of your revenue and the numbers that drive it, and every report shows what changed. Our clients' results so far:</p>
      <ul>{REVENUE_PROOF.map((r) => <li><strong>{r.pre}{r.value}{r.suf}</strong> {r.label}, <a href={'/case-studies/' + r.slug + '/'}>{r.client}</a></li>)}</ul>
      <h2>Who does the work?</h2>
      <p>A small senior team, on purpose. The people who plan your growth are the people who build and run it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap grid3" style="margin-top:20px">
      {team.map((t) => (
        <div class="card" style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center">
          <img src={t.img} alt={`Portrait photo of ${t.name} of The Grow Revenue Company`} width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" style="border-radius:50%;width:96px;height:96px;object-fit:cover" />
          <div><h3 style="font-size:1.3rem;margin:0">{t.href ? <a href={t.href}>{t.name}</a> : t.name}</h3><p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:.95rem">{t.role}</p></div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="narrow prose">
      <h2>What is our track record?</h2>
      <p>Beyond our case studies, our public record is on Upwork, where anyone can read every review: {PROOF.map((p) => `${p.value} ${p.label}`).join(', ')}, with Top Rated Plus status.</p>
      <h2>What do we work on?</h2>
      <ul>{SERVICES.map((s) => <li><a href={'/' + s.slug + '/'}>{s.nav}</a>: {s.blurb}</li>)}</ul>
      <h2>How do we work?</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Diagnose</strong> with your numbers, not opinions.</li>
        <li><strong>Plan</strong> by ranking every channel and fix by expected revenue.</li>
        <li><strong>Launch</strong> campaigns, content and systems with your approval on anything public.</li>
        <li><strong>Grow</strong> by moving budget to what earns and cutting what does not.</li>
      </ol>
      <h2>Company details</h2>
      <p>{SITE.legalName}{SITE.companyNumber ? `, registered in England and Wales, company number ${SITE.companyNumber}` : ''}. Registered address: {SITE.address.street}, {SITE.address.city} {SITE.address.postcode}, United Kingdom. Email: <a href={'mailto:' + SITE.email}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
